&lt;h2 id="简介"&gt;简介&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;18岁校花李晓婷，放学途中被五名不良混混绑架，遭受残酷调教、开苞、穿环、兽交等羞辱，彻底沦为狗奴。刑警姐姐李晓彤与母亲林语寒先后营救却相继落网，一家三口美艳母女在混混与局长父子的掌控下，被迫顺从、接客、轮奸，最终完全堕落为任人玩弄的性奴。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="章节列表"&gt;章节列表&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/gao-leng-xiao-hua-yu-shuang-jing-hua-mu-nv-de-che-di-duo-luo-IFhn/reader/1" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;1高冷校花李晓婷被擒获调教&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/gao-leng-xiao-hua-yu-shuang-jing-hua-mu-nv-de-che-di-duo-luo-IFhn/reader/2" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;2李晓婷被‌‍‍‌开‍‎苞‍‌‍穿环&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/gao-leng-xiao-hua-yu-shuang-jing-hua-mu-nv-de-che-di-duo-luo-IFhn/reader/3" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;3晓婷被皮鞭抽‍‌‍‎阴‎‎蒂‎‌、电刑、打脚心&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/gao-leng-xiao-hua-yu-shuang-jing-hua-mu-nv-de-che-di-duo-luo-IFhn/reader/4" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;4女刑警李晓彤被擒获审讯&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/gao-leng-xiao-hua-yu-shuang-jing-hua-mu-nv-de-che-di-duo-luo-IFhn/reader/5" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;5晓彤穿警服被混混们爆‌‎‎‎肏‎‎‍‌‍‎‌‎‍，犯了错被亲妹妹打屁股&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/gao-leng-xiao-hua-yu-shuang-jing-hua-mu-nv-de-che-di-duo-luo-IFhn/reader/6" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;6晓彤被‌‎‎‎肏‎‎‍‌‍‎‌‎‍‎‍屁‎‍‌眼‌‌‍，两姐妹跳裸衣舞、骑木马、‌‍‎‌兽‍‌交‌&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/gao-leng-xiao-hua-yu-shuang-jing-hua-mu-nv-de-che-di-duo-luo-IFhn/reader/7" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;7女刑警队长林语寒被混混‍‌调‎‌‎‍教‎‎‌‍‍，语寒被亲女儿打‎‍屁‎‍‌眼‌‌‍&lt;/a&gt;
